5,1,1,talk,Midori,,I want to ensure we have clear accountability and a plan that stays relevant. I will look into support ownership during last winter's outage and board minutes on capital and operating requests.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"I will examine the yard devices and the 2021 scheduling trial, as well as the depot calendar and the peak-season cutover. I need to know how new systems handle our actual operational environment.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,May,,I'll be checking the upgrade history of the dispatch tool and the five years of renewal invoices. I want to see if we're just patching old holes or actually moving forward!,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Misaki,,"I will look into administrator retirements and hiring times, as well as depot supervisors and the last rollout. I want to understand the human capacity for this transition.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,I shall investigate the five years of renewal invoices and the board minutes on capital and operating requests. I suspect the true cost of ownership is often hidden in the fine print.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
